mudi (0.2.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename the project to MuDi (牧笛): binary, desktop entry, icon,
    settings store and release assets are now "mudi"; an existing
    deepin-herdr settings store is imported on first run.
  * Fix the frontend failing to enter herdr when relaunched while the
    server is still running: the client was spawned before the window
    was laid out and exited on a zero-sized terminal grid; the spawn
    is now deferred until after show().
  * Add in-app updater (mirror racing, SHA-256 verification) with a
    progress banner and a paginated settings dialog.
  * Add agent state desktop notifications (AgentMonitor).
  * Use DTK only on deepin/UOS and a generic Qt window shell elsewhere;
    vendor terminalwidget sources for all-platform builds.
  * Auto-restart the herdr server after stop and attach reliably, with
    lifecycle banners and a fallback plain shell.
  * Add CI build matrix (linux x86_64/aarch64, macOS) with optional
    libchardet.

 -- re2zero <yangwu@uniontech.com>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 11:30:00 +0800

deepin-herdr (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Integrate extended theme menu into DTK titlebar menu.
  * Add theme name mapping to resolve Theme1-10 to real names (Elementary, Empathy, etc.).
  * Add theme persistence using QSettings to save and load selected theme on startup.
  * Use DTK translation for 'Theme' menu via qApp->translate("TitleBarMenu", "Theme").

 -- re2zero <yangwu@uniontech.com>  Wed, 09 Jul 2026 10:00:00 +0800

deepin-herdr (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bind terminal color scheme to theme: dark=Theme7, light=Theme10.
  * Fix translation context mismatch for application description.
  * Add StartupWMClass to .desktop for dock icon matching.
  * Fix stale socket detection when herdr exits abnormally.
  * Support Qt5/Qt6 dual build via QT_DIR cmake variable.
  * Clean up freopen stdout/stderr redirection.
  * Use DApplication::loadTranslator() for translation loading.

 -- re2zero <yangwu@uniontech.com>  Tue, 02 Jun 2026 15:30:00 +0800

deepin-herdr (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * DTK6/Qt6 GUI frontend for herdr terminal workspace manager.
  * Embeds herdr client in QTermWidget.
  * Auto-downloads herdr binary on first launch.

